  <section class="pk-section">
    {{ sectionHeading('Under the hood', 'Built like real software', actionLink('https://github.com/jthingelstad/elixir-bot', 'View the code on GitHub →', 'outline', '', true)) }}
    <p class="pk-elixir-tech-copy">Elixir pairs a <strong>deterministic data engine</strong> with an <strong>LLM awareness loop</strong>. Clash Royale data flows through a single API ingress into append-only receipts and durable event streams — and <strong>code, not the model, owns every promotion, demotion, and kick</strong>. A cheap model gates the expensive one on the post-or-stay-quiet call, which cut running cost by roughly 10×.</p>
